tasks.description:
Integrate a real-time employee attendance and logged hours tracking feature into the business app, showing total active employees, daily/weekly/monthly logged hours, and check-in statuses at a glance.  &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Display key metrics cards for Total Employees and Logged Hours (Today, This Week, This Month). &#x20;

✅ Update employee check-in and check-out status dynamically in real time.&#x20;

✅ Ensure smooth navigation to detailed employee logs and reporting views.
